RULE                   STATE  MAX   DESCRIPTION
cognitive-complexity   on     15    a function is hard to understand: too many branches, nested too deep
cyclomatic-complexity  off    20    a function has too many paths to test
function-length        on     70    a function is too long to fit on a screen
nesting-depth          on     4     control structures are nested too deep
file-length            on     1000  a file is too long
duplication            on     -     a block of code is a copy of another one
shellcheck             on     -     ShellCheck findings, one rule per SC code
parse-error            on     -     a file is not valid bash
baseline-stale         on     -     a baseline row tolerates more than the code needs: lower it
